kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "source-ingestion-summary-and-conversion"
purpose: 定义单来源派生能力与内容转换能力：来源摘要、来源范围 QA、来源问答转来源，以及对话/输出转来源或笔记。该规范强调转换结果可追踪且遵循来源生命周期，避免产生不可检索或不可归因的数据。
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[15]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r49,"Source summary is cache-first with explicit regenerate",来源摘要 GET MUST 仅允许 ready 来源且 MUST NOT 调用 LLM：有 metadata.autoSummary 则返回缓存；无缓存时 MUST 返回 200 空态（空 summary/要点/主题，generatedAt 可空）。摘要的生成与覆盖 MUST 仅由 POST 同 path（或 ingest ready 后的异步预生成）完成并写入 metadata.autoSummary。
  r107,"Source-scoped QA is hard-bounded by sourceId",来源 QA MUST 仅在该 `sourceId` 范围内检索与回答。
  r144,Source QA conversion creates reusable source,来源问答转换 MUST 创建新来源并可立即用于后续检索。
  r179,Conversation/output conversion keeps traceable metadata,对话或输出转换为来源/笔记时 MUST 记录来源元数据与追踪信息。
  r211,Conversion follows source lifecycle and epoch rules,任何创建新来源的转换路径 MUST 遵循 source 状态机与 epoch 失效规则。
  "summary-qa-error-and-ownership","Summary and per-source QA MUST return 400 for not-ready and verify notebook ownership","summary 和 per-source QA 端点在 source 未 ready 时 MUST 返回 400（非 404），且 MUST 校验 source 属于 URL 中的 notebook"
  "qa-to-source-contract","qa-to-source MUST accept messages list contract","qa-to-source 端点 MUST 接受 messages:[QAMessage] 列表并格式化为 markdown（对齐 v1 convert_source_qa_to_source），MUST NOT 只接受单轮 {question, answer}"
  "qa-to-source-must-accept-multi-turn-messages","qa-to-source conversion MUST accept multi-turn messages list (not single-turn pair)","qa-to-source 转换 MUST 接受 messages: list[QAMessage] 多轮历史并格式化为完整 transcript；MAY 另接受单轮 {question, answer}。实现：ConvertSourceQAToSourceRequestSchema + source-extras.router.ts。"
  "tag-binding-must-return-per-item-diagnostics","Tag assign/remove MUST return per-item results with errorCode","tag 批量 assign/remove MUST 返回 per-item 结果 {sourceId, ok, message, errorCode}；缺失/跨 notebook source SHALL 报 SOURCE_NOT_FOUND。实现：sources/router.ts + SourceTagBindingResponseSchema。"
  "csv-parser-must-escape-cells","CSV parser MUST escape pipes and newlines in markdown-table cells","CSV parser MUST 转义 markdown-table 单元格中的 |（转义为 \\|）、换行（转义）、截断用 … 省略号（对齐 v1 csv.py:61-67）；实现见 apps/server/src/features/sources/parsers/csv.ts（formatCell：先 escape 再截断 …）。"
  "convert-embedding-no-ready-on-fail",Source conversion MUST NOT mark ready when embedding fails,"QA-to-source 和 session convert-to-source MUST 在 embedding 失败时标记 source 为 failed 而非 ready"
  "per-source-qa-vector-search","Per-source QA MUST use vector retrieval","per-source QA MUST 通过 embed question + scoped vector search 检索相关 chunk，而非简单取前 N 个 chunk"
  "from-url-link-mode","From-url MUST support link mode","from-url 端点 MUST 支持 mode=link 创建轻量 source（不 fetch URL 内容）"
  "summary-post-persists-auto-summary",POST summary MUST persist autoSummary,"POST /v2/notebooks/:nid/sources/:sid/summary MUST 对 ready 来源生成摘要结构，MUST 将结果 merge 写入 sources.metadata.autoSummary，并 MUST 返回与有缓存时 GET 相同形状的 SourceSummary。"
  "summary-async-after-ready","Ingest MUST async-pregenerate summary after ready",来源 ingest 成功标记 ready 后，系统 SHOULD 异步预生成并写入 metadata.autoSummary；预生成失败 MUST NOT 将 source 标为 failed，也 MUST NOT 阻塞 ingest 成功响应。
scenarios[16]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r49,"get-returns-cache-without-llm",ready 来源已有 metadata.autoSummary,客户端 GET summary,系统 SHALL 返回缓存内容且不调用聊天模型,false
  r49,"get-empty-when-missing",ready 来源尚无 autoSummary,客户端 GET summary,系统 SHALL 返回 200 空态且不调用聊天模型,false
  r107,"qa-does-not-cross-source-boundary","",用户对某个 `sourceId` 发起来源范围 QA,系统 SHALL 仅在该来源范围内检索与回答,true
  r144,"converted-qa-becomes-a-new-source","",用户将来源问答结果转换为来源,系统 SHALL 创建新来源并使其可用于后续检索,true
  r179,"conversion-stores-provenance","",用户将对话或输出转换为来源/笔记,系统 SHALL 记录可追踪的元数据以支持溯源与审计,true
  r211,"conversions-bump-epochs-and-respect-lifecycle","",转换路径创建了新的来源并写入向量或来源集合,系统 SHALL 遵循状态机并按规则 bump 相关 epoch,true
  "summary-qa-error-and-ownership","source-not-ready",source 状态非 ready,客户端请求 summary 或 QA,系统 SHALL 返回 400 而非 404,true
  "qa-to-source-contract","client-sends-messages",客户端发送 messages 列表,转换执行,系统 SHALL 接受并格式化为 markdown 后创建 source,true
  "qa-to-source-must-accept-multi-turn-messages","multi-turn-convert",客户端发送多轮 messages 历史,"系统执行 qa-to-source",SHALL 格式化完整 transcript 并转换（与 v1 一致）,true
  "tag-binding-must-return-per-item-diagnostics","tag-binding-missing-source",批量 assign 中某 sourceId 不存在,系统返回结果,"SHALL 在 results 里报 {sourceId, ok:false, errorCode:SOURCE_NOT_FOUND}（非静默跳过）",true
  "csv-parser-must-escape-cells","csv-cell-with-pipe",CSV 单元格含 | 字符,"parser 产出 markdown-table","SHALL 转义为 \\|（不破坏 table 结构）",true
  "convert-embedding-no-ready-on-fail","qa-to-source-fail","embedding API 在 QA-to-source 过程中失败",source 状态更新,系统 SHALL 标记 source 为 failed 而非 ready,true
  "per-source-qa-vector-search","large-source-qa",一个 source 有 50 个 chunk,用户对该 source 提问,系统 SHALL 通过向量检索返回最相关的 chunk 而非前 15 个,true
  "from-url-link-mode","link-mode",用户提供 URL 且 mode=link,"from-url 调用",系统 SHALL 创建轻量 source 不执行 HTTP fetch,true
  "summary-post-persists-auto-summary","post-writes-metadata",ready 来源无或已有 autoSummary,客户端 POST summary,系统 SHALL 生成并写入 metadata.autoSummary 且响应含完整摘要字段,false
  "summary-async-after-ready","ready-triggers-async-summary",文件 ingest 即将完成,source 被标记为 ready,系统 SHALL 在不阻塞响应的前提下尝试异步写入 autoSummary；失败不改 status,false
